== item water_bottle
name: water bottle
image: water_bottle
description: A sealed bottle of water.
weight: 1
category: drink
use:
    if player.thirst > 0:
        You drink the whole bottle.
        ~ drink 25
    else:
        You aren't thirsty, so you put the bottle back.
        ~ cancel use

== item can_of_beans
name: can of beans
image: can_of_beans
description: A dented but sealed can of beans.
weight: 1
category: food
use:
    You eat the beans cold, straight from the can.
    ~ eat 30

== event stray_dog
name: A stray dog
found by: exploring in streets
repeat: until resolved
outcomes: fed, chased_off, bitten
tags: feral, canine
play:
    A thin dog watches you from behind an overturned bin, ribs showing.
    * Offer it some water [if player has water_bottle]
        You pour water into your hand. The dog drinks, then trots off, tail up.
        ~ take water_bottle
        ~ outcome fed
        ~ resolve
    * Chase it away
        fight stray_dog:
            won:
                The dog yelps and runs.
                ~ outcome chased_off
            lost:
                It bites your hand before bolting.
                ~ hurt 3
                ~ outcome bitten
    * Leave it alone
        You keep your distance. The dog keeps its own.

== creature stray_dog
name: stray dog
// A deliberately simple opponent for testing the combat instruction.
hp: 12
level: 1
damage: 3

== item energy_drink
name: energy drink
image: energy_drink
description: A can of something fizzy and far too sweet.
weight: 1
category: drink
use:
    You down the can in one go. Your heart starts racing.
    ~ drink 10 quietly
    ~ condition wired for 6 hours

== condition wired
name: Wired
shows: Too much caffeine to sleep.
blocks rest: yes
rest refusal: Too much caffeine keeps you awake.
while active:
    feat + jittery
each turn:
    Your fingers drum on everything within reach.
ends:
    The buzz fades, leaving you tired and a little shaky.
